  "sourceTitle": "Boursin Cheese",
  "sourceText": "Boursin Cheese\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 8, 2009 - 11:13pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 8 oz. pkg. cream cheese\n1 tablespoon sour cream\n1 clove garlic, minced, or 1/8 tsp. powder\n1 tablespoon Parmesan cheese\n1 teaspoon marjoram\n1 tablespoon chives\n1 tablespoon minced parsley\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place the cream cheese in a bowl and soften. Add the rest of the ingredients and mix. Serve with crackers (stoned wheat thins are good) !",
